  "tier": "told-once",
  "plain": "In 2011, while a treasure-hunting team was diving on a strange object found on the floor of the Baltic Sea, a navy ship, taken to be Swedish, appeared in the distance and headed straight for their boat. An unnamed crew member who was on board tells this, on an episode with the treasure hunter Dennis Asberg, saying \"suddenly we saw\" the ship \"heading directly on us\". It is told as one of several strange events around the site that suggested official interest in the find."
